    "description": {
      "content": "The Gleap REST API provides programmatic access to feedback tickets, user identification, event tracking, help center content, outbound messaging, sessions, contacts, and AI-powered support workflows. The API uses Bearer token authentication and supports filtering, pagination, and webhook integrations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gleap Support\n Email: hello@gleap.io",
